{"id":"00297","root":"uni00297_1","name":{"ja":"メルシー","en":"Merci"},"title":{"ja":"【ホットチョコ】","en":"【Hot Chocolate】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【ホットチョコ】 メルシー","en":"【Hot Chocolate】 Merci"},"aliases":["Mercy"],"element":"Superhuman","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2020-02-13","limited":true,"characterId":149,"profile":{"ja":"妖精ケットシーになった元・メスの猫。猫だった頃は、不愛想な老婆に拾われ、ただ“猫”とそっけなく呼ばれながら世話になっていた。老婆はかつて裕福だったが、詐欺によって全財産を失い、人間不信となり、最後は借金を負わされたまま路上で凍死した。主を失った猫もそのまま死に至るかと思われたが、人間界に紛れていた妖精ケットシーに助けられて魔界に行き、妖精となった。名前はなく、ただ“猫”と呼ばれていたため、老婆が最後に呟いた言葉を自分の名前としている。しばらくはケットシーとして魔界にいたが、馴染めず、人間界に戻ってきた。妖精となって人間に近い姿を得てからは、色香を使って人を誘惑する楽しみも覚えた。老婆の影響か、金を集める事にも貪欲で、現在は人と金が集まるヨミハラの街を荒らしている。猫だった時は食べられなかったが、今では甘くて体をあたためる効果のあるチョコレートが好物になった。寒い冬は苦手だが、街にチョコが溢れる２月は好きで、この日だけはお金よりチョコを集めて回っている。","en":"Merci is a former female cat who became a fairy kettsie. As a cat, she was taken in by a gruff old woman who called her simply \"cat\" while caring for her. The woman had once been wealthy but lost everything to fraud, grew distrustful of humans, and eventually froze to death on the streets while still in debt. When the cat's master died, she seemed destined to follow, but a fairy kettsie hiding in the Human Realm rescued her and took her to the Demon Realm, where she transformed into a fairy. Lacking a name and still called \"cat,\" she adopted the last words the old woman muttered as her own name. After spending some time as a kettsie in the Demon Realm, she felt out of place and returned to the Human Realm. As a fairy with a more human-like form, she discovered the pleasure of using her charms to tempt people. Perhaps influenced by the old woman, she's also greedy for money and now roams the bustling streets of Yomihara, preying on crowds of people and cash. While she couldn't eat chocolate as a cat, she now loves the sweet, warming treat. She dislikes the cold winter, but she adores February when chocolate fills the city, and on that day she hunts for chocolate rather than money."},"il